## Common Anti-Patterns

- ❌ Manual resource creation in UI → ✅ Define all resources in `databricks.yml`
- ❌ Hardcoded environment names → ✅ Use `${bundle.target}` variables
- ❌ Direct Parquet/CSV writes → ✅ Always use Delta Lake format
- ❌ Skipping Unity Catalog registration → ✅ Register all tables and models in Unity Catalog
- ❌ Running apps locally → ✅ Deploy to Databricks Apps platform
- ❌ Committing secrets to Git → ✅ Use Databricks Secrets and environment variables
- ❌ No validation before deploy → ✅ Always run `databricks bundle validate`

